    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A stroke of bad luck brought you to the Sheltering Hands, a selfless organization dedicated to protecting the downtrodden. They helped you get back on your feet and taught you some of their protective magic, hoping that one day you too would shelter those in need.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Constitution, Wisdom, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.Gbe5hF4qtWazQkP1]{Arcane Safeguard}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Insight and Medicine</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulCooksUtens]{Cook's Utensils}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulCooksUtens]{Cook's Utensils}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBlanket0000]{Blanket}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagHealersKit0]{Healer's Kit}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagLamp0000000]{Lamp}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagOil00000000]{Oil} (3 flasks), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagTinderbox00]{Tinderbox}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagWaterskin00]{Waterskin}, 40 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
